flowchart TD
  Alert[Alertmanager or normalized alert] --> Intake[Authenticate, validate and deduplicate]
  Intake --> Incident[Persist incident + optional normalized evidence]
  Replay[Operator starts seeded replay] --> Incident
  Incident --> Start[Operator starts investigation]
  Start --> Gate{Valid operator, scope and request?}
  Gate -->|No| Deny[Return an error; do not start workflow]
  Gate -->|Yes| Idempotency{Completed run for key?}
  Idempotency -->|Yes| Reuse[Return stored report]
  Idempotency -->|No| Run[Persist run ID; use it as LangGraph checkpoint ID]
  Run --> Sources[Read bounded logs, metrics, traces and change observations]
  Sources --> Normalize[Keep provenance and timestamps; deduplicate evidence]
  Sources -. Provider or tool failure .-> Error[Record tool error]
  Normalize --> Diagnose[Deterministic signature evaluation]
  Error --> Diagnose
  Diagnose --> Confidence{Enough evidence, no tool errors,<br/>clear lead over competitors?}
  Confidence -->|No| Abstain[Inconclusive; no action proposal]
  Confidence -->|Yes| Supported[Evidence-linked cause + rationale]
  Supported -. Optional, with consent .-> Model[Model can rank fixed candidates only]
  Abstain --> Save[Persist result, evidence, events and audit trail]
  Supported --> Save
  Model --> Save
  Save --> Report[Return report to browser, CLI or API client]
  Report --> ProposalRequest[Operator separately requests proposal]
  ProposalRequest --> Eligible{Supported cause + active matching replay<br/>+ allowlisted action?}
  Eligible -->|No| ActionDenied[409; external incidents cannot use simulator actions]
  Eligible -->|Yes| Proposal[Store immutable typed parameters + hash]
  Proposal --> Review{Separate approver role approves<br/>before expiry?}
  Review -->|No / expired| Stop[Block execution; investigate and propose again]
  Review -->|Yes| Execute[Operator executes once in simulator]
  Execute --> Verify{Server checks health,<br/>symptom and action scope}
  Verify -->|Pass| Closed[Mark resolved; retain verification record]
  Verify -->|Fail| Open[Keep incident unresolved; retain failure record]

  classDef process fill:#EFF6FF,stroke:#2563EB,color:#0F172A;
  classDef decision fill:#FFFBEB,stroke:#D97706,color:#0F172A;
  classDef success fill:#F0FDF4,stroke:#16A34A,color:#0F172A;
  classDef failure fill:#FEF2F2,stroke:#DC2626,color:#0F172A;
  class Alert,Intake,Incident,Replay,Start,Run,Sources,Normalize,Diagnose,Abstain,Supported,Model,Save,Report,ProposalRequest,Proposal,Execute,Verify process;
  class Gate,Idempotency,Confidence,Eligible,Review decision;
  class Reuse,Closed success;
  class Deny,Error,Abstain,ActionDenied,Stop,Open failure;
